                        "form": "die Kinnbärte"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8278c30c-4c48-3102-812d-b46a64d3dfda",
                        "entry_id": "39d2ad38-5602-35a6-aeb2-4f556a7ec7bf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Bart am Kinn"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a83778c2-82b5-40d2-ac81-8546dec901e2",
                                "sense_id": "8278c30c-4c48-3102-812d-b46a64d3dfda",
                                "text": "„Ich trage einen Kinn- und Schnurrbart, rasiere mir aber die Wangen; da besagter Bart in der Mitte einen dunklen Skunkstreifen und weiße Ränder hat, erinnert er an gewisse Verwandte.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e70e6467-0948-48a0-94aa-2e2e7393f1e8",
                                "sense_id": "8278c30c-4c48-3102-812d-b46a64d3dfda",
                                "text": "„Der Kinnbart, wie ihn die Beatniks in den USA tragen, unterscheidet ihn von den anderen Mitgliedern der Politikerkaste in Léopldville.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0c14e464-bf77-41fe-b0aa-1afbde5b7a18",
                                "sense_id": "8278c30c-4c48-3102-812d-b46a64d3dfda",
                                "text": "„Jákup war ein kräftiger alter Mann mit breiten Hüften, der den gleichen Kinnbart trug wie die Ziege des Korporals.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a1a874bb-77bd-4221-8f2a-5d139638c8ff",
                                "sense_id": "8278c30c-4c48-3102-812d-b46a64d3dfda",
                                "text": "„In seinem Kinnbart hängen Schweißtropfen.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4e0f49de-aefa-4112-aa56-4623f1696217",
                        "source_entry_id": "39d2ad38-5602-35a6-aeb2-4f556a7ec7bf",
                        "source_sense_id": "8278c30c-4c48-3102-812d-b46a64d3dfda",
                        "source_sense_description": "Bart am Kinn",
                        "target_lang_word": "goatee",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "goatee",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0d70c983-e00f-30b4-a82e-2846d4c48f43",
                                        "entry_id": "9314755d-ebe7-389e-8632-969da9879782",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A beard trimmed to grow only at the center of the chin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88f2ed6a-2f10-4000-94ed-892738607bb7",
                                                "sense_id": "0d70c983-e00f-30b4-a82e-2846d4c48f43",
                                                "text": "One person sports a goatee, the hair refusing to grow on the sides of his physiognomy; the chin of another is as smooth as a baby's cheek,—he contents himself with a modest moustache and a faint attempt at an imperial; while a few of the upper classes rejoice in all the varieties."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b355618-bad3-4a21-8764-539e5e9b1ce2",
                                                "sense_id": "0d70c983-e00f-30b4-a82e-2846d4c48f43",
                                                "text": "The terrorist, as he called himself, was old and bald, with a narrow, snow-white wisp of a goatee hanging limply from his chin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3fc0bbb0-9e71-45c1-8c15-49038ba41d42",
                                                "sense_id": "0d70c983-e00f-30b4-a82e-2846d4c48f43",
                                                "text": "\"Yes, sir, behind you. He is a man of middle size, rather inclined to shortness. He is old, over sixty, with white hair, curved nose and a white, small beard of the variety that is called goatee.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
